{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-in-the-ai-workflow","title":"Testing In The Ai Workflow","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/testing-in-the-ai-workflow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tests-in-the-inner-loop","title":"内层循环里的测试","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/testing-in-the-ai-workflow/tests-in-the-inner-loop","wordCount":1990,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"tests-in-ci-as-gate","title":"CI 里作为门禁的测试","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/testing-in-the-ai-workflow/tests-in-ci-as-gate","wordCount":2238,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"evolving-the-test-suite","title":"让测试套件持续演进","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/testing-in-the-ai-workflow/evolving-the-test-suite","wordCount":2443,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲测试怎么嵌进 AI 时代的开发工作流,让它在对的时刻给对的反馈:内层循环里要有快测试(agent 改一点就随手跑、watch/只跑相关的、秒级反馈),让纠错回路转得紧;CI 里要有完整测试作为合入硬门,兜住本地漏掉的、挡住未验证的产出进主干;还要让测试套件随项目持续演进——补该补的、删过时的、治脆的、随代码一起改测试,别让它腐烂成又慢又脆又没人信的负担。三者合起来:快测试在内层给即时反馈、完整测试在 CI 兜底把关、持续维护让套件长期可信。\n"}